
---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact MyRigFoundry | Get in Touch"
  description="Contact Leonardo Ribeiro and MyRigFoundry for feedback, technical corrections, questions and business inquiries."
>
  <section class="info-page">
    <div class="info-container">
      <p class="eyebrow">CONTACT MYRIGFOUNDRY</p>

      <h1>Let's talk about technology.</h1>

      <p class="info-lead">
        Have a question about one of our guides, noticed something
        that needs correcting, or want to share feedback?
        MyRigFoundry welcomes messages from readers and technology
        enthusiasts.
      </p>

      <div class="info-content">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>

        <p>
          MyRigFoundry is an independent project created and
          maintained by Leonardo Ribeiro. For questions, suggestions
          or other inquiries, you can reach out using the contact
          information below.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <span class="contact-label">EMAIL</span>

          <a href="mailto:framing.estudiodigital@gmail.com">
            framing.estudiodigital@gmail.com
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2>Corrections and technical feedback</h2>

        <p>
          Technology changes constantly. Drivers receive updates,
          hardware specifications evolve and troubleshooting
          recommendations can become outdated.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you notice incorrect information, a broken link or
          something that could be explained more clearly, please
          let us know.
        </p>

        <p>
          When contacting us about an article, include its title
          or URL and describe the issue you noticed. This helps
          us identify and review the information.
        </p>

        <h2>Business and partnership inquiries</h2>

        <p>
          For advertising, partnerships or other business-related
          inquiries, please use the contact email and include
          a brief description of your proposal.
        </p>

        <div class="article-note">
          <strong>Editorial approach</strong>

          <p>
            Our goal is to provide useful troubleshooting information
            and recommendations based on the needs of PC users.
            Commercial relationships should not compromise the
            accuracy or transparency of our content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2>Connect with the founder</h2>

        <p>
          You can also find Leonardo Ribeiro on LinkedIn to learn
          more about the person behind MyRigFoundry and his work
          in technology and software development.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardo-ribeiro-834907409/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Visit Leonardo's LinkedIn profile →
          </a>
        </p>

        <p>
          Thank you for visiting MyRigFoundry and taking the time
          to get in touch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
